  "subtitle": "The design of our internal knowledge graph platform is shown in three types of figures: the data model (ERD), the layered architecture, and a mind map of design considerations. All are single-file, work offline, and have no external dependencies.",
  "footer": "Source: Platform Design Review · 2026-06-07 · UNIFIED HTML SYSTEM demo (shape: diagram / theme: dark-focus)",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"erd stack\" aria-label=\"Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD)\">\n  <h2>Figure 1 — Data Model ERD</h2>\n  <p class=\"muted small\">The core schema of the knowledge graph. Documents are created by users, extracted as entities, and connected many-to-many between nodes via relations.</p>\n  <div class=\"erd-stage\" data-zoompan data-zoom-min=\"0.5\" data-zoom-max=\"2.4\" tabindex=\"0\">\n    <div class=\"zoom-controls no-print\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\">+</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" data-zoom-out aria-label=\"Zoom out\">&minus;</button>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" data-zoom-reset aria-label=\"Reset zoom\">&#x2922;</button>\n      <span class=\"zoom-readout\" data-zoom-readout>100%</span>\n    </div>\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 680\" data-draggable role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Entity relationship diagram of the knowledge graph schema (drag entities to rearrange)\">\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"erd-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"var(--text-muted)\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <g data-viewport>\n        <line class=\"erd-link\" data-edge data-from=\"users\" data-to=\"documents\" marker-end=\"url(#erd-arrow)\"/>\n        <text class=\"erd-link-label\" data-edge-label=\"users-documents\">1:N</text>\n        <line class=\"erd-link\" data-edge data-from=\"documents\" data-to=\"entities\" marker-end=\"url(#erd-arrow)\"/>\n        <text class=\"erd-link-label\" data-edge-label=\"documents-entities\">1:N</text>\n        <line class=\"erd-link nm\" data-edge data-from=\"entities\" data-to=\"relations\" marker-end=\"url(#erd-arrow)\" marker-start=\"url(#erd-arrow)\"/>\n        <text class=\"erd-link-label\" data-edge-label=\"entities-relations\">N:M</text>\n      <g class=\"erd-node\" data-node=\"users\" transform=\"translate(40,50)\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"users entity (draggable)\">\n        <rect class=\"erd-hit\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"236\" rx=\"12\"/>\n        <foreignObject x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"236\">\n          <article class=\"erd-entity card-outlined\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <header class=\"erd-head\">users</header>\n            <ul class=\"erd-rows\">\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">id</span><span class=\"chip pk\">PK</span><span class=\"erd-type\">uuid</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">email</span><span class=\"erd-type\">varchar(255)</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">display_name</span><span class=\"erd-type\">varchar(120)</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">role</span><span class=\"erd-type\">enum</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">created_at</span><span class=\"erd-type\">timestamptz</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </article>\n        </foreignObject>\n      </g>\n      <g class=\"erd-node\" data-node=\"documents\" transform=\"translate(520,50)\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"documents entity (draggable)\">\n        <rect class=\"erd-hit\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"274\" rx=\"12\"/>\n        <foreignObject x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"274\">\n          <article class=\"erd-entity card-outlined\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <header class=\"erd-head\">documents</header>\n            <ul class=\"erd-rows\">\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">id</span><span class=\"chip pk\">PK</span><span class=\"erd-type\">uuid</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">author_id</span><span class=\"chip fk\">FK</span><span class=\"erd-type\">uuid</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">title</span><span class=\"erd-type\">varchar(300)</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">body</span><span class=\"erd-type\">text</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">status</span><span class=\"erd-type\">enum</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">indexed_at</span><span class=\"erd-type\">timestamptz</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </article>\n        </foreignObject>\n      </g>\n      <g class=\"erd-node\" data-node=\"entities\" transform=\"translate(520,390)\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"entities entity (draggable)\">\n        <rect class=\"erd-hit\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"236\" rx=\"12\"/>\n        <foreignObject x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"236\">\n          <article class=\"erd-entity card-outlined\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <header class=\"erd-head\">entities</header>\n            <ul class=\"erd-rows\">\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">id</span><span class=\"chip pk\">PK</span><span class=\"erd-type\">uuid</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">document_id</span><span class=\"chip fk\">FK</span><span class=\"erd-type\">uuid</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">label</span><span class=\"erd-type\">varchar(200)</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">kind</span><span class=\"erd-type\">enum</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">embedding</span><span class=\"erd-type\">vector(768)</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </article>\n        </foreignObject>\n      </g>\n      <g class=\"erd-node\" data-node=\"relations\" transform=\"translate(40,390)\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"relations entity (draggable)\">\n        <rect class=\"erd-hit\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"236\" rx=\"12\"/>\n        <foreignObject x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"240\" height=\"236\">\n          <article class=\"erd-entity card-outlined\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n            <header class=\"erd-head\">relations</header>\n            <ul class=\"erd-rows\">\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">id</span><span class=\"chip pk\">PK</span><span class=\"erd-type\">uuid</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">source_id</span><span class=\"chip fk\">FK</span><span class=\"erd-type\">uuid</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">target_id</span><span class=\"chip fk\">FK</span><span class=\"erd-type\">uuid</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">predicate</span><span class=\"erd-type\">varchar(120)</span></li>\n        <li class=\"erd-row\"><span class=\"erd-col\">weight</span><span class=\"erd-type\">numeric(4,3)</span></li>\n            </ul>\n          </article>\n        </foreignObject>\n      </g>\n      </g>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cluster no-print\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-sm\" data-drag-reset>Reset layout</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"cluster erd-legend\" aria-label=\"Cardinality legend\">\n    <span><span class=\"chip\">1:1</span> One-to-one</span>\n    <span><span class=\"chip\">1:N</span> One-to-many</span>\n    <span><span class=\"chip\">N:M</span> Many-to-many (dashed)</span>\n  </div>\n</section>",
      "cssModules": [
        "erd"
      ]
    },
