      "type": "html",
      "html": "<div class=\"stack\">\n  <h2>Figure 2 — System Architecture</h2>\n  <p class=\"muted small\">A four-layer architecture from ingestion to the search API. Synchronous calls use HTTP / gRPC, while the extraction pipeline is loosely coupled through an event-driven (pub-sub) approach.</p>\n</div>"
    },
